{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣藝人楊丞琳（Rainie）向來鍾愛毛孩，過去她曾飼養愛犬Yumi長達17年，可惜自Yumi離世後她便沒有再養狗狗，時隔差不多5年後，Rainie上月中在毫無預警下於社交網宣布迎來新成員「乖乖」。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:04:02.410461+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:44:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:21.661874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:21.661874+00:00","content_hash":"e6889448375bebb0c2d3f1f135f72ed567c3e1fbd0278fed73cb609294c68ca8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}